omtether (0.5.0~beta2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Tether tab: PTP/IP bridge checkbox (exposes the camera to libgphoto2) and
    an "Open darktable…" button that starts the bridge and launches darktable
    with the LD_PRELOAD shim it needs to see it.
  * Bridge: accept any initiator GUID, answer 0xD052 locally, announce the
    single 0xC102 event libgphoto2 waits for.
  * The GUI no longer needs anything else running: the tethering engine lives
    inside it, and its state file creates its own directory.

omtether (0.5.0~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public beta.
  * PTP/IP transport, session and discovery (mDNS, SSDP, port scan).
  * USB pairing (ConnectPcInfo) with the reversed-MAC initiator GUID.
  * Real-time download daemon, remote capture, timed exposure and ISO.
  * Live view, MJPEG server and an INDI server for KStars/Ekos.
  * PyQt6 desktop app (tether / remote control / astrophotography), bilingual
    UI (Spanish/English), desktop entry and icon.
  * CLI for everything, in English and Spanish docs.

